11je|a|Pertaining to, or near, the horizon. ; Parallel to the horizon; on a level; as, a horizontalline or surface. ; Measured or contained in a plane of the horizon; as, horizontal distance.	j:so2,102,28;6zw,94,12;1yzm,88,6;26hm,86,10;6rw,84,5;20f8,80,2;1a2o,77,57;usn,75,6;118l,71,7;yqj,68,6;6d2,68,13;n93,65,15;1j81,62,3;1a21,60,39;6u8,60,12~1a2o,77,57;1a21,60,39;so2,102,28;n93,65,15;6d2,68,13;6u8,60,12;6zw,94,12;26hm,86,10;118l,71,7;22sm,37,7;1qwm,30,7;1yxc,28,6;yqj,68,6;1yzm,88,6;usn,75,6	e:1mkn,36,3;2j4,24,4~2j4,24,4;1mkn,36,3
